description:
Write the ring buffer that feeds `PlotLines`, with the statistics for its overlay:

```cpp
class History
{
public:
    explicit History(int capacity);
    void push(float value);
    int count() const;                 // samples stored, up to capacity
    int offset() const;                // index of the oldest sample (0 until the buffer is full)
    float at(int i) const;             // the i-th oldest sample, 0 = oldest
    float average() const;             // 0 when empty
    float maximum() const;             // 0 when empty
    std::string overlay() const;       // "avg 16.7  max 21.3", one decimal each
};

float smooth(float previous, float value, float k);   // exponential smoothing: previous + (value - previous) * k
```

`at(i)` must give samples in order from oldest to newest, whether or not the buffer has wrapped round.

